fn gui_bare_display_storage_step_applied_new %fn GuiBareDisplayStorageState fn GuiBareDisplayStorageEffect fn GuiBareFramebufferStepApplied GuiBareDisplayStorageStepApplied \state\effect\framebuffer_step:
